  "kind": "statement",
  "title": "Permanence under a lisse tensor",
  "statement": "Let $X$ be smooth of pure\ndimension $d$, let $K\\in D^b_c(X,\\overline{\\mathbf Q}_\\ell)$ and let\n$\\mathcal L$ be lisse\nof finite rank. Then\n\n$$\nK\\in{}^pD^{\\le0}(X)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nK\\otimes^L\\mathcal L\\in{}^pD^{\\le0}(X),\n\\qquad\nK\\in{}^pD^{\\ge0}(X)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nK\\otimes^L\\mathcal L\\in{}^pD^{\\ge0}(X),\n$$\n\nand the analogous assertions hold for the shifted subcategories.",
  "source": {
    "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-deligne-laumon-a1/sk-p-dl-a1-perverse/lem-per-lisse-tensor-permanence.md",
    "place": "node lem-per-lisse-tensor-permanence, order 2741"
  },
  "stmt_deps": [
    "def-per-perverse-subcategories",
    "def-weil-pbc-constructible-complexes",
    "def-weil-pbc-scheme-conventions"
  ],
  "proof": [
    {
      "text": "For the $\\le$-direction: the cohomology sheaves of\n$K\\otimes^L\\mathcal L$ have support contained in the support of the\ncorresponding sheaves of $K$ (the tensor with the lisse sheaf is\nexact, and the module over each point is the tensor with the free\n$\\mathcal L_{\\bar x}$, of the same support), so the support\ninequalities of [def-per-support-condition] for $K$ imply the\nones for $K\\otimes^L\\mathcal L$. For the $\\ge$-direction: by\n[lem-per-dual-lisse-tensor],\n$D_X(K\\otimes^L\\mathcal L)\\cong D_XK\\otimes^L\\mathcal L^\\vee$, and\napplying the $\\le$-direction to the lisse sheaf\n$\\mathcal L^\\vee$ gives\n$\\operatorname{SuppCon}(D_X(K\\otimes^L\\mathcal L))$ from\n$\\operatorname{SuppCon}(D_XK)$, which is\n$\\mathrm{CosuppCon}(K\\otimes^L\\mathcal L)$ from\n$\\mathrm{CosuppCon}(K)$ by [def-per-support-condition].",
      "uses": [
        "def-per-support-condition",
        "lem-per-dual-lisse-tensor"
      ],
      "elementary": false
    }
  ],
  "proof_deps": [
    "def-per-support-condition",
    "lem-per-dual-lisse-tensor"
  ],
